<title>USA: U.S. Cellular Corp Q3 net down.</title>
<headline>U.S. Cellular Corp Q3 net down.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.30		    $0.38</p>
<p> Net			 26,140		   32,263</p>
<p> Revs		     187,594		  138,567</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  86,158		   84,561</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 operating earnings, excluding gains on sales, $0.28 a share vs $0.18 in Q3 1995.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 net income includes gain on sale of cellular, other investments of $7,797,000 vs $42,301,000.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.38		    $0.95</p>
<p> Net			118,582		   79,950</p>
<p> Revs		     510,280		  355,439</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  86,002		   83,846</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 results include gain on sale of celluar, other investments of $132.8 million vs $77.7 million.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
